      "content": "The idea of \"starting over\" is a huge, crushing concept, and you don't have to tackle that massive weight today. Instead of thinking about rebuilding your entire life, think about the smallest possible next step—something that requires almost no energy. When the score is zero, sometimes the only logical move is to stop the game entirely and simply rest. Please consider letting a professional help you carry the weight of this decision so you don't have to hold it alone.",
